.eggs/
# Anchored: these are setuptools build output at the repo ROOT. Unanchored,
# `lib/` matched every directory named `lib` at any depth and silently swallowed
# `e2e/lib/http_assert.sh` — a dependency the smoke test sources, which would
# have been absent from every fresh clone. The only `lib` directory in the tree
# is `e2e/lib`; `.venv_311/` is ignored wholesale on its own line.
/lib/
/lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

# PyInstaller
#  Usually these files are written by a python script from a template
#  before PyInstaller builds the exe, so as to inject date/other infos into it.
*.manifest
*.spec

